{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Gameplay</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo you'll jump, slide, bounce, boost and bubble your way through dense forests and dreamscapes, searching for <i>spirit drops</i>\u00a0to improve her abilities. The game offers fluid momentum-based platforming physics, which allow you to find your own creative ways to explore the landscape.\u00a0If you're someone that enjoys secrets, there are plenty to be found...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/b7a3da7e7228b32f676a35f6c6d1e6c4.avif?t=1772018380\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras_big/b7a3da7e7228b32f676a35f6c6d1e6c4.webp?t=1772018380 width=1560 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valerie's magic is all focused around bubbles - use the <strong>bubble-boost</strong> to propel yourself, and the\u00a0<strong>bubble-gun</strong> to freeze enemies in a bubble. These bubbles will help you reach higher places. That way there's no need to hurt anybody, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/e4411df91eafaa00f4027dd7e71a9ea7.poster.avif?t=1772018380\" width=1170 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/e4411df91eafaa00f4027dd7e71a9ea7.webm?t=1772018380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/e4411df91eafaa00f4027dd7e71a9ea7.mp4?t=1772018380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Story</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valerie is a young girl who has been taken by her mother to see the <i>Unbound Society</i> in order to sharpen her magic skills. However, after being begrudgingly left to her own devices, another motive takes her fancy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/d592dfec570c6330de1cf5890a8aeed6.poster.avif?t=1772018380\" width=358 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/d592dfec570c6330de1cf5890a8aeed6.webm?t=1772018380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/d592dfec570c6330de1cf5890a8aeed6.mp4?t=1772018380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fluid platforming challenges with bubbles, bouncing, boosting and slopes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A caring story of a mother and her child</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A whimsical sprinkle of humour</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Artwork, soundtrack and story created by the developer, Jole</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Secret collectibles and more to find</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Many cats (sometimes)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/8d93853febb032829c66f4f13c58ead1.poster.avif?t=1772018380\" width=584 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/8d93853febb032829c66f4f13c58ead1.webm?t=1772018380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Remember to wishlist the game and follow on socials,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">the full game will only be possible with your support!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>- Jole</i></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3568960?t=1772018380","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3568960?t=1772018380","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/1f9c15275dc6963cbaa1d1a81d02d44cde8ccba0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772018380","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/1f9c15275dc6963cbaa1d1a81d02d44cde8ccba0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772018380","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3591070,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>